    "description": "In this video, Chef John demonstrates how to make his mouthwatering Caramel Apple Pie. The recipe adds a caramel sauce that's poured over the apples and lattice crust, creating a delicious and intensely flavorful pie. The filling consists of sliced apples, cinnamon, and a pinch of salt. The lattice crust is made with a homemade pie crust, and the butter-sugar mixture is poured on top of the pie. The pie is baked for 15 minutes at 425 degrees F, then reduced to 350 degrees F and baked for an additional 35-40 minutes. The result is a golden-brown crust, bubbling apple filling, and set caramel on top. Whether you're a seasoned baker or a novice, this recipe is sure to impress your guests.",
